<div class="fit">
<h2>Who this session is designed for</h2>
<p class="fit-lead">The working session is most useful for:</p>
<div class="fit-grid">
<div class="fit-item"><span class="fit-dot"></span>Organisations with 200+ employees or equivalent complexity</div>
<div class="fit-item"><span class="fit-dot"></span>HR or reward leaders rethinking their grading methodology</div>
<div class="fit-item"><span class="fit-dot"></span>Organisations looking for more transparency in job evaluation</div>
